[20.236,"o","── PLAN · nothing below has run ───────────────────────────────────────\r\nThis is what ov does in your AWS account (region eu-south-2); --debug shows every command:\r\n\r\n  1. SSH key: import the stack's own key pair into the region (.openvidu/aws/openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129-key.pem)\r\n  2. Template: render the single node template into .openvidu/aws/cf-openvidu-pro-singlenode.yaml\r\n     and its parameters into .openvidu/aws/cfn-parameters.json (0600)\r\n  3. Bucket: stage the template in the S3 bucket openvidu-cfn-templates-***-eu-south-2 (created once, reused by every stack)\r\n  4. Network: the region's default VPC, vpc-0e2358cb016b9fef5 (the template places the machine there)\r\n  5. Machines: Create the CloudFormation stack openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129 with the machine, which installs OpenVidu Pro on itself (about 5 minutes)\r\n  6. Wait for OpenVidu to be up, read what it published (URL, credentials) and register this directory as the stack\r\n── end of plan ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\r\n\r\n\r\n▶ Create the machines on AWS…\r\n   · SSH key pair for this stack: .openvidu/aws/openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129-key.pem\r\n"]
[21.01,"o","   · import its public half into eu-south-2 as the key pair openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129-key\r\n"]
[23.39,"o","   · create the CloudFormation stack openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129 from .openvidu/aws/cf-openvidu-pro-singlenode.yaml (this returns when CloudFormation is done)\r\n"]
[28.39,"o","note: recorded this stack's infrastructure in openvidu-stack.yml, so `ov stack destroy` removes it even if the wait below fails\r\n   ✓ Create the machines on AWS\r\n\r\n▶ Wait for the machines to deploy OpenVidu…\r\n"]
[33.39,"o","   · OpenVidu is up\r\n   ✓ Wait for the machines to deploy OpenVidu\r\n\r\n▶ Register the stack…\r\n"]
[34.359,"o","\r\nStack described by the deployment:\r\n  name         openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129\r\n  deployment   single_node_pro · aws · pro\r\n  version      ov-admin\r\n  modules      dashboard, egress, ingress, meet, observability\r\n  dashboard    https://openvidu-wegk4b-89-60-151-61.sslip.io\r\n  published    by ov ov-admin on 2026-11-13 10:35 UTC (generation 1)\r\n\r\n"]
[34.364,"o","✔ registered stack \"openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129\" in <run>/openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129/stack\r\n   ✓ Register the stack\r\n\r\n✔ OpenVidu Pro (single node) is up on AWS\r\n  URL:          https://openvidu-wegk4b-89-60-151-61.sslip.io/\r\n  credentials:  aws secretsmanager get-secret-value --secret-id openvidu-eu-south-2-openvidu-e2e-aws-pro-a102129 --query SecretString --output text --region eu-south-2\r\n\r\nTry it:\r\n  ov stack status\r\n  ov stack logs --tail 50\r\n"]
